pages.p6:
In the broad paved gathering space of the square, Facundo — a tall young adult man with short tousled dark brown hair, clean-shaven angular jaw, brown eyes, wearing a crooked orange wide-brimmed tricorn hat, an open brown leather waistcoat over an orange linen shirt, dark brown cropped wide-leg sailor trousers, brown leather knee-high boots, an orange fabric sash, and a beaded necklace — plants his boots firmly on the muddy earth at the base of the monumental stone pedestal and shoves a heavy stone slab sideways across the ground. The wide shot shows his powerful forward lean, his palms pressed flat against the rough edge of the thick slab, pushing it entirely clear of the dark, perfectly circular shaft opening it had concealed. Rain washes over the classical statue base rising in the background and slickens the heavy paving stones all around the newly exposed drop.

