pages.p8:
Lorena — a young adult woman with dark brown wavy shoulder-length hair tied in a ponytail, brown eyes, wearing a purple wide-brimmed tricorn hat pinned up on one side, a loose purple linen blouse with gathered sleeves, a purple fabric sash, dark grey cropped wide-leg sailor trousers, and black leather knee-high boots with buckle straps — leans forward at a steep angle, her right boot planted firmly downward onto the first rough-hewn wet grey stone block inside the dark opening. In her extended left hand, the antique brass lantern glows bright and warm, the yellow light illuminating her focused face against the encroaching darkness below. The medium shot frames her determined descent from the knees up, the rain-slicked rim of the stone fountain basin blurring in the immediate background above her head.

